[5.395565, "o", "\r\n"]
[5.405367, "o", "transport dante (socks5 127.0.0.1:1082)\r\n  reachable         yes\r\n  known-open        open      reply 0x00         2.2ms\r\n  known-closed      closed    reply 0x05         1.8ms\r\n  blackholed        error     reply 0x01         1.3ms   <- expected filtered\r\n\r\n  fidelity          full\r\n  This proxy reports refused connections distinctly (0x05), so scanr can\r\n  tell `closed` apart from `filtered` in your results.\r\n\r\n  to record this, add to [transports.dante]:\r\n      fidelity = \"full\"\r\n"]
[7.907327, "o", "\r\n\u001b[2;36m# dante says 0x05 for refused, 0x01 for unreachable: fidelity full, so closed is real.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[10.310925, "o", "\u001b[1;32m$\u001b[0m s"]
